;; physics tick, unparked from decompiler/config/jakx/ntsc_v1/hacks.jsonc's
;; asm_functions_by_name. The earlier hold's own divergence claim was real,
;; not an artifact: this rung's clean decode confirms a 2-loop design with no
;; float compares, no retry back-branch and no third loop, dispatching
